        "TileImage": "$($repository 87be73e8-64a2-4381-8438-013bb5d4f241).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47,\r\rOne year ago, you dismantled the Sheikh’s empire. However, new intelligence confirms the inventor eliminated in New Zealand was a twin — a decoy. The real architect survived and has resumed his work under new backers.\r\rAdditionally, two captured operatives are at risk of compromising ICA secrets.\r\rYour objectives are clear: eliminate the true inventor and silence the operatives.\r\rGood hunting, 47",
